# 175 entries at 6.7.13 (DERIVED, the same grep). 6.7.13 added SEVEN — struct_values_one_dereference_typer_and_implicit_
# addresses_v6713 (structs), multi_value_fall_off_lands_at_the_fn_end_and_the_replay_end_v6713 (multi-value),
# tools_lane_host_compilers_masks_and_dry_passes_v6713, receives_post_parse_records_and_the_capture_prescan_v6713,
# vector_values_receives_arguments_and_dereferences_v6713, windows_flock_relock_and_lock_state_in_the_kernel_v6713
