# 168 entries at 6.7.12 (DERIVED, the same grep). 6.7.12 added FIVE — vector_addresses_typed_copies_and_zero_as_none_v6712
# (fix-first), native_region_rules_and_the_macho_fold_report_v6712 (darwin), windows_locks_links_and_fixtures_that_carry_linux_v6712,
# a_const_two_peers_share_turns_a_paste_every_peer_harness_into_a_compile_error_v6712 (stdlib),
# tools_lane_signals_pairs_paths_and_the_lock_v6712; the rest went INTO class entries: the step word (its third field),
# one reading (a restated refusal list, cyrlint's N, type-audit's `<..>`), the emitted-bytes class (its tenth: an x86
# offset kept at emit time), a stated cause (Darwin's 48 from a brief; a size under page rounding), the syscall-number
# class (a shift row drops the dirfd; a raw-issued alias no name check sees), the XLAT fold (the x86 twin), a cap
# believed in five places (cx's five bounds; the PE note's byte count), wine is not Windows (four more), the TLS class
